  "details": "Grafana is an open source, feature rich metrics dashboard and graph editor for Graphite, InfluxDB & OpenTSDB.   \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * net/[http:](http:) golang: golang: Denial of Service via crafted HTTP Range headers (CVE-2026-78667)\n  * crypto/tls: golang: crypto/tls: Denial of Service via multiple ECH outer extension references (CVE-2026-97031)\n  * net/[http:](http:) net/http/internal/http2: golang.org/x/net/http2: net/[http:](http:) Denial of Service via excessive HTTP/2 SETTINGS frames (CVE-2026-78669)\n  * crypto/x509: golang: crypto/x509: Man-in-the-middle attacks via untrusted intermediate certificates (CVE-2026-111943)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
